From: John Murray <5672686+JRMurr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 22:08:54 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Hands: FRAMETOP_HOST_BUILDS runs ft-hands on the host

ft-cutouts and the hand recorder (session.tracker_argv) ran hands/build's
ft-hands in the dev container. With FRAMETOP_HOST_BUILDS=1 they run it directly.
---
 hands/ft-cutouts                     |  9 +++-
 hands/rec/session.py                 | 38 ++++++++++++---
 hands/rec/tests/test_tracker_argv.py | 33 +++++++++++++
 hands/tests/test_cutouts.py          | 72 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 143 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 hands/rec/tests/test_tracker_argv.py
 create mode 100644 hands/tests/test_cutouts.py

diff --git a/hands/ft-cutouts b/hands/ft-cutouts
index f678c9d..4a84b13 100755
--- a/hands/ft-cutouts
+++ b/hands/ft-cutouts
@@ -11,6 +11,8 @@
 set -euo pipefail
 here=$(cd "$(dirname "$(readlink -f "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")")" && pwd)
 camd=frametop-cutouts-camd.service hands=frametop-cutouts-hands.service
+# FRAMETOP_HOST_BUILDS=1: build/ft-hands is built for the host (frametop-nix), not the dev container.
+host_builds=${FRAMETOP_HOST_BUILDS:-0}
 
 die() { echo "$*" >&2; exit 1; }
 
@@ -34,11 +36,14 @@ case ${1:-status} in
       echo "stopping ft-handsctl's hand tracking (it has pinches and grips)"
     fi
     run_unit $camd frametop-camd.service "the camera broker" "$here/build/ft-camd" --status 60
+    box=("$HOME/.local/bin/distrobox" enter dev --)
+    [ "$host_builds" = 1 ] && box=()
     if ! systemctl --user -q is-active $hands; then
-      "$here/../scripts/container-up.sh"  # so stopping the unit can't take the container down
+      # so stopping the unit can't take the container down
+      [ "$host_builds" = 1 ] || "$here/../scripts/container-up.sh"
       pkill -x ft-hands || true
     fi
-    run_unit $hands frametop-hands.service "hand tracking, no gestures" "$HOME/.local/bin/distrobox" enter dev -- \
+    run_unit $hands frametop-hands.service "hand tracking, no gestures" "${box[@]}" \
       "$here/build/ft-hands" --status 60 --no-gestures
     "$here/ft-handsctl" cutouts on >/dev/null || true
     sleep 4
